04:05:00,580 --> 04:05:07,170
It's not as bad as I thought it would be. 99.5% of people that rated it liked it.

1006
04:05:09,890 --> 04:05:17,040
What is my average? Oh, it's less than my average stream, though, by 0.3%.

1007
04:05:19,140 --> 04:05:24,660
I genuinely expected it to be worse.

1008
04:05:28,550 --> 04:05:34,180
Oh gosh, that tells me that I can never ever play this game again.

1009
04:05:40,010 --> 04:05:52,350
There's a puppy at the door. She wants out. I have to go with what the people want. I'm just kidding.

1010
04:05:53,980 --> 04:06:04,530
I'm just kidding. I'm trying to abandon that mindset. I'm sorry. I might play Stardew every day for a month if that's what I want to do.

1011
04:06:06,850 --> 04:06:14,930
I don't think that's what I want to do. I thought I was going to play it today, but I got pretty into what I was doing already.

1012
04:06:17,280 --> 04:06:33,520
I feel a little bad. I am drifting a tiny bit away from Red Dead. I think because I just still, I'm still struggling a bit with the shooting. I've never played shooters with a controller before, and maybe it would be more fun if I did play with keyboard and mouse.

1013
04:06:35,250 --> 04:06:55,160
I guess I, silly of me, I didn't think there'd be that much of it, of the aiming, I guess. But I do think that I want, there's something nice about playing it outside of the shooting part with the controller. And I think I'm finally understanding the other things I'm supposed to do with the controller.

1014
04:06:56,880 --> 04:07:07,690
So, I do want to—and I do want to overall improve controller skills outside of Souls games, where they're not that good to begin with.

1015
04:07:11,350 --> 04:07:19,420
It does feel comfier to play it with a controller. Another game I think I want to play is Kingdom Hearts because I've watched, like,

1016
04:07:20,710 --> 04:07:42,800
watched the full gameplay, like, on YouTube of Kingdom Hearts 1 and then Kingdom Hearts 2. Not Kingdom Hearts 3, that was way too long. But I cannot imagine playing that with that. Like, I—that's not a game meant for mouse and keyboard, right? And there's no aiming in it, so that's a game where I'm like, I need to use the controller for that. I need to get better at the controller.

1017
04:07:47,390 --> 04:07:53,180
Yeah. But before I start too many, I want to also make sure I finish games.

1018
04:07:56,370 --> 04:08:02,130
I do want to finish Katamari. Once I finish Katamari, then I play Wind Waker, I think.

1019
04:08:04,520 --> 04:08:13,510
I have heard that Kingdom Hearts 1 is kind of like not hard, but it can be annoying to play. I asked my friends who have all played it.

1020
04:08:17,590 --> 04:08:20,220
And I forgot what they said was frustrating about it.

1021
04:08:23,000 --> 04:08:27,930
Yeah, it's harder because it's older, right? It's not that the game itself is hard, it's just kind of…

1022
04:08:29,340 --> 04:08:34,920
kind of janky or something. It's aged badly. 「You hate playing some levels.」 Uh-oh.

1023
04:08:36,380 --> 04:08:42,210
「Gameplay hasn't aged well.」 「Of its time.」 I see. I want to try it, though.

1024
04:08:44,800 --> 04:08:49,240
I'll try. Okay, at some point.

1025
04:08:55,260 --> 04:09:03,850
Oh, I stretch and I go. I'm hungry, and my dog is looking at me like she's miserable because she can't go outside this room until I'm done.

1026
04:09:05,390 --> 04:09:10,950
Okay, thank you for hanging out today. I don't know when I'll be around again. I'll try to.

1027
04:09:12,930 --> 04:09:19,360
give a heads-up earlier. Sometimes I just don't know until I'm like, yeah, you know, I feel—I'm feeling…

1028
04:09:22,620 --> 04:09:28,420
Okie doke. Bye bye. Okay. Bye bye.

